sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant R as React (5173)
  participant G as API Gateway (3000)
  participant A as AI Agent Service (4004)
  participant Q as Groq
  participant P as Player Data Service (4001)
  participant E as External API Service (4003)

  U->>R: Ask for a playtime and weather tip
  R->>G: POST /api/ai/insights
  G->>A: POST /insights (x-api-key)
  A->>Q: messages + tool schemas
  Q-->>A: call getPlayerStats(userId)
  A->>P: GET /users/1/stats (x-api-key)
  P-->>A: stats JSON
  A->>Q: tool result
  Q-->>A: call getWeather(city)
  A->>E: GET /weather?city=... (x-api-key)
  E-->>A: weather JSON
  A->>Q: tool result
  Q-->>A: final answer
  A->>A: validate JSON schema, add toolsUsed
  A-->>G: 200 { result, toolsUsed, aiGenerated: true }
  G-->>R: 200 JSON
  R-->>U: Cards + "How this answer was produced"
